#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527692"
msgid "Well done, Senpai.\nHow did you like the enemy marathon of hell?\nDid you suffer?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529348"
msgid "…what did she say?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "529436"
msgid "BB's voyeurism."
